  "notes": "Warm off-white (#f6f5f2) canvas with white rounded panels and 1px #ececea hairlines; near-black (#111113) primary buttons; single indigo (#4f5ae0) accent for progress bars. Distinctive inline viz chips inside the PDF: tiny 10px pill buttons color-coded by type (rose 3D model, violet formula, blue graph, amber animation, green source) with truncated labels, a type icon and a hover label; clicking one switches the right panel to the Visualizer showing e.g. a KaTeX formula with step-by-step derivation. Tool panel switcher offers Visualizer, Knowledge Graph, Chat, Flashcards, Quizzes, Feynman. Quiz uses lettered A–D option cards with a green correct state and a 'Why this is right' explanation box. A floating pill page navigator and zoom control sit at the bottom of the reader. No codebook entry exists for a quiz / self-assessment question pattern (proposal filed: quiz)."
